ine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是固定 PR 呈示且满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\omega(T)\">\\(R_\\omega(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{URefl}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{URefl}(T)\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" href=\"?note=f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" title=\"67-df-iterated-consistency\">67-df-iterated-consistency</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bfe810351301dc7b\" href=\"?note=bfe810351301dc7b\" title=\"67-df-local-reflection\">67-df-local-reflection</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"045076ed5daf4d97\" href=\"?note=045076ed5daf4d97\" title=\"67-df-iterated-local-reflection\">67-df-iterated-local-reflection</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4837cec0530b35f0\" href=\"?note=4837cec0530b35f0\" title=\"67-df-uniform-reflection\">67-df-uniform-reflection</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；下式的集合是各理论的可证句集，真包含表达演绎意义的严格强弱。</li>\n<li>一致性迭代与局部反思共同使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" href=\"?note=f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" title=\"67-df-iterated-consistency\">67-df-iterated-consistency</a> 的种子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_T\">\\(\\sigma_T\\)</span>，并绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_T}\\)</span>；不得在同一比较中改变证明公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:T\\cup\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(T)\\vdash\\varphi\\}\\subsetneq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:T\\cup\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\vdash\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:T\\cup\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(T)\\vdash\\varphi\\}\\subsetneq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:T\\cup\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\vdash\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:T\\cup R_\\omega(T)\\vdash\\varphi\\}\\subsetneq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:T\\cup\\mathrm{URefl}(T)\\vdash\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:T\\cup R_\\omega(T)\\vdash\\varphi\\}\\subsetneq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}:T\\cup\\mathrm{URefl}(T)\\vdash\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条的原书页码及既往核对记录继承自输入档案；本轮未提供原书 PDF，这些记录不表示本轮重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>对应印刷55页/PDF66页定理4的两项严格包含；这里保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可靠性。第一项将所有有限一致性迭代与一次局部反思比较，第二项将所有有限局部反思迭代与源书编码型一致反思比较，不能把第二项降成只比较一次局部反思。</p>\n<p>已读源证明：引理3把局部反思推进到加一致性句的反思，把一致反思推进到加局部反思的反思；严格性分别用有界公理化障碍和真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 句组成的一致上界。完整内部算术化和有界压缩证明未独立重建，保留受限证明资格。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"As